<title>USA: American List sets meeting date for vote.</title>
<headline>American List sets meeting date for vote.</headline>
<dateline>MINEOLA, N.Y. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>American List Corp said on Thursday that it has set July 11, 1997, for a shareholder meeting to vote on a merger agreement with Snyder Communications Inc.</p>
<p>The close of business on June 4, 1997 has been set as the record date for the determination of holders of American List common stock entitled to vote at the special meeting, the database company said.</p>
</text>
